		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Filthy green-brown lurking ooze, pestilent and reeking. Eats those who dwell above.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 40, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 tentacle +5 (1d10), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Command Ooze</strong>. Oozes and slimes hearing blight's commands, CHA 15+ or charmed for 1d8 days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Acid immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Plagued Domain</strong>. Upon first entering blight's domain, CON 9+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
